Third-party notice

The directory `official/` contains an unmodified snapshot of the upstream
HALLMARK implementation (https://github.com/rpatrik96/hallmark), distributed
under its own MIT license; see `official/LICENSE`. The fixed upstream revision
is recorded in `official/VERSION.txt`.

The directory `data/` contains the upstream v1.2 dataset and baseline outputs.
It is redistributed for reproducibility of the course project; consult the
upstream repository for the authoritative dataset terms. The course paper and
its bibliography are provided for academic review.
